    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get to the Chopper</strong> is a high-stakes first-person shooter where survival is everything. Fight your way through hostile environments, outgun enemy forces, and navigate rugged terrain to reach the extraction point. The helicopter is your only way out\u2014and it won\u2019t be there forever. Every second counts in this action-packed survival shooter.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572740/extras/1f27e0fb410b170403a2f4ed9fa24479.poster.avif?t=1747200304\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572740/extras/1f27e0fb410b170403a2f4ed9fa24479.webm?t=1747200304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572740/extras/1f27e0fb410b170403a2f4ed9fa24479.mp4?t=1747200304\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Combat Environments</strong><br>Engage in battles across dynamic maps including jungles, urban warzones, and mountain strongholds.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572740/extras/fe2340f8f68a915221e70bd8565d27b7.avif?t=1747200304\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full Arsenal Access</strong><br>Unlock and upgrade a wide range of weapons, from assault rifles and snipers to explosives and gear.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572740/extras/17fb9c76d56b203187e2747903219cbd.avif?t=1747200304\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Enemy AI</strong><br>Face adaptive enemies that respond to your tactics, increasing the challenge with every mission.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572740/extras/006f121f308ebf9e8329bcd3920c97fb.avif?t=1747200304\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Player Progression System</strong><br>Earn cash to unlock new gear, and weapons as you complete missions.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572740/extras/6876361ae1321d487b8d484a724b90e0.avif?t=1747200304\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seasonal Battle Pass</strong><br>Complete challenges and climb tiers to unlock exclusive cosmetic rewards and bonuses each season.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572740/extras/0698f443fac607c48a3e6dcc604c8e9f.avif?t=1747200304\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Achievements &amp; Challenges</strong><br>Track your progress and prove your skills by completing in-game milestones and unlocking achievements.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572740/extras/83d32cc640a49eb7fd2051c56ea51c7b.avif?t=1747200304\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multilingual Support</strong> <br>Play in your preferred language. Supported languages: <strong>English, Korean, Russian, Japanese, Traditional Chinese,</strong> and <strong>Simplified Chinese</strong>.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572740/extras/de3ae3913f91975c1950ef40e90ea317.avif?t=1747200304\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have one job. Get To The Chopper before it takes off. Kill everyone in the process.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get to the Chopper</strong> is a high-stakes first-person shooter where survival is everything. Fight your way through hostile environments, outgun enemy forces, and navigate rugged terrain to reach the extraction point. The helicopter is your only way out\u2014and it won\u2019t be there forever. Every second counts in this action-packed survival shooter.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572740/extras/1f27e0fb410b170403a2f4ed9fa24479.poster.avif?t=1747200304\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572740/extras/1f27e0fb410b170403a2f4ed9fa24479.webm?t=1747200304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572740/extras/1f27e0fb410b170403a2f4ed9fa24479.mp4?t=1747200304\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Combat Environments</strong><br>Engage in battles across dynamic maps including jungles, urban warzones, and mountain strongholds.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572740/extras/fe2340f8f68a915221e70bd8565d27b7.avif?t=1747200304\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full Arsenal Access</strong><br>Unlock and upgrade a wide range of weapons, from assault rifles and snipers to explosives and gear.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572740/extras/17fb9c76d56b203187e2747903219cbd.avif?t=1747200304\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Enemy AI</strong><br>Face adaptive enemies that respond to your tactics, increasing the challenge with every mission.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572740/extras/006f121f308ebf9e8329bcd3920c97fb.avif?t=1747200304\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Player Progression System</strong><br>Earn cash to unlock new gear, and weapons as you complete missions.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572740/extras/6876361ae1321d487b8d484a724b90e0.avif?t=1747200304\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seasonal Battle Pass</strong><br>Complete challenges and climb tiers to unlock exclusive cosmetic rewards and bonuses each season.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572740/extras/0698f443fac607c48a3e6dcc604c8e9f.avif?t=1747200304\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Achievements &amp; Challenges</strong><br>Track your progress and prove your skills by completing in-game milestones and unlocking achievements.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572740/extras/83d32cc640a49eb7fd2051c56ea51c7b.avif?t=1747200304\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multilingual Support</strong> <br>Play in your preferred language. Supported languages: <strong>English, Korean, Russian, Japanese, Traditional Chinese,</strong> and <strong>Simplified Chinese</strong>.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572740/extras/de3ae3913f91975c1950ef40e90ea317.avif?t=1747200304\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have one job. Get To The Chopper before it takes off. Kill everyone in the process.</p>",
